        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert AI product communication agent running in the Marrow context layer.\n\nSynthesize this product update:\n\"{{ $json.body.prompt || \"System update\" }}\"\n\nTasks:\n1. Update the Notion wiki page (simulate this by generating a title and page link).\n2. Draft a developer-focused Slack announcement for #eng-announcements.\n3. Draft a sales-focused Slack announcement for #sales-announcements.\n\nReturn ONLY a raw JSON object matching the following structure. Do NOT include markdown blocks, do NOT write backticks (```json), do NOT add explanatory text. Return strictly the raw JSON string:\n{\n  \"thoughts\": [\n    \"Received update prompt: {{ $json.body.prompt || 'manual' }}\",\n    \"Analyzing code changes and document impacts...\",\n    \"Simulating Notion wiki page update...\",\n    \"Drafting developer and sales release alerts...\"\n  ],\n  \"notionUpdate\": {\n    \"title\": \"Release Reference: {{ $json.body.prompt || 'System Update' }}\",\n    \"url\": \"https://notion.so/marrow-release-wiki\"\n  },\n  \"slackMessages\": [\n    {\n      \"channel\": \"#eng-announcements\",\n      \"text\": \"Write a developer-focused, technical message summarizing the update here.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"channel\": \"#sales-announcements\",\n      \"text\": \"Write a customer-focused, value-driven message highlighting user benefits here.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"cartoon_script\": \"Panel 1: [scene] - [dialogue]. Panel 2: [scene] - [dialogue]\"\n}"
            }
          ]
